- You're not!

153
00:14:07,012 --> 00:14:13,936
Wait, don't tell me... You haven't
even asked her out yet. Are you kidding?

154
00:14:15,145 --> 00:14:18,023
Come on. Shouldn't you express your love?

155
00:14:18,983 --> 00:14:23,445
Meet in a nice spot with the sun shining
down and share your feelings. Muster up

156
00:14:23,529 --> 00:14:27,825
