236
00:20:31,438 --> 00:20:33,690
Don't worry! Don't worry!

237
00:20:33,774 --> 00:20:36,985
Actually, you should have more
confidence in yourself. There's a ton of

238
00:20:37,069 --> 00:20:38,946
guys out there!

239
00:20:50,624 --> 00:20:51,750
I mean. I'm one.

240
00:20:54,127 --> 00:20:57,172
And I'd say yes... if it's you.

241
00:22:27,137 --> 00:22:31,767
From the beginning It was
already clear to me... but still...

242
